.TH QUIPU-FORK-PROMOTE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fork\-promote \- Promote a fork to ROOT
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fork promote\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIname\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Promote a fork to ROOT
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIname\fR>

